---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const entry = {
  "id": "harvard_ii1_33",
  "series": "Band II 1 (1663 - 1685)",
  "seq": 33,
  "text": "<p> [[105.14]] <b>29. LEIBNIZ AN JAKOB THOMASIUS</p>\n<p> [[105.15]] Frankfurt, [3. Oktober] 1670. [17.30.]</b></p>\n<p> [[106.4]] Physica neque elegantius, neque amoenius, quam dialogo explicari possunt. Memini\n[[106.5]] idem facere Bodinum, idem Gualterum Rivium, <i>de vera ratione librae et staterae</i>, sed et in\n[[106.6]] <i>itinere Ecstatico</i> Kircherum, et passim illustrem Boylium, atque inprimis eleganter nuperrime\n[[106.7]] Georgium Sinclarum, in <i>arte nova gravitatis et levitatis</i>: ut tot alios veteres mediosve, ac mediis\n[[106.8]] propiores taceam. Ceterum doctissimum virum Abdiam Treu non ignoras, libros Aristotelis\n[[106.9]] <greek>perì fysikh̃w ăkroásevw</greek> in scientiae formam elementaque, Euclidis exemplo reducere\n[[106.10]] voluisse, ne soli Cartesiani de mathematica methodo gloriarentur. </p>\n<p> [[106.11]] Vidi nuper programma Lipsiense, haud dubie tuum, quo libellum intolerabiliter licentiosum,\n[[106.12]] de libertate philosophandi, pro eo ac merebatur, tractasti. Videtur auctor non tantum\n[[106.13]] politicam, sed et religionem Hobbianam sectari, quam is in <i>Leviathane</i> suo, monstroso, vel\n[[106.14]] tituli indicio, opere sic satis delineavit. Nam et Criticae illius bellissimae, quam in scripturam\n[[106.15]] sacram homo audax exercet, semina integro <i>Leviathanis</i> capite Hobbius jecit. Hobbium ipsum\n[[106.16]] octuagenario majorem repuerascere nuper ex literis responsoriis Henrici Oldenburgii, societatis\n[[106.17]] regiae Anglicanae secretarii, didici. </p>\n<p> [[106.18]] Idem haec recentissima Boylii opera memorat: 1) <i>de formarum et qualitatum origine,</i>\n[[106.19]] 2) <i>de argumento illo, num detur absoluta, seu perfecta quies in corporibus etiam solidissimis,</i>\n[[107.1]] 3) <i>de qualitatibus systematicis, sive Cosmicis,</i> 4) <i>de suspicionibus Cosmicis,</i> 5) <i>de regionum\n[[107.2]] subterranearum iuxta ac submarinarum temperie, deque maris fundo. Quibus accessit ejusdem\n[[107.3]] introductio ad historiam de qualitatibus particularibus.</i> Francof. d. 23 Dec. 1670. </p>\n",
  "number": "29.",
  "title": "LEIBNIZ AN JAKOB THOMASIUS",
  "date": "Frankfurt, [3. Oktober] 1670. [17.30.]"
};
---

<Layout title={`${entry.title || entry.id} - Leibniz Writings`}>
  <article data-pagefind-body>
    <header class="entry-header">
      <h1 data-pagefind-meta="title">{entry.title || entry.id}</h1>

      <div class="entry-meta">
        {entry.date && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Date:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="date">{entry.date}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Series:</strong>
          <span data-pagefind-meta="series">{entry.series}</span>
        </div>

        {entry.number && (
          <div class="meta-item">
            <strong>Number:</strong>
            <span data-pagefind-meta="number">{entry.number}</span>
          </div>
        )}

        <div class="meta-item">
          <strong>Sequence:</strong>
          <span>{entry.seq}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="entry-content" data-pagefind-meta="excerpt:29. LEIBNIZ AN JAKOB THOMASIUS Frankfurt, [3. Oktober] 1670. [17.30.] Physica neque elegantius, neque amoenius, quam dialogo explicari possunt. Memini idem facere Bodinum, idem Gualterum Rivium, de vera ratione librae et staterae, sed et in itinere Ecstatico Kircherum, et passim illustrem Boylium, a...">
      <div class="text-content">
        {entry.text.split('\n').map(paragraph =>
          paragraph.trim() && <p set:html={paragraph} />
        )}
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <nav class="entry-navigation">
    <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Search</a>
  </nav>
</Layout>

<style>
  .entry-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border);
  }

  .entry-header h1 {
    color: var(--primary);
    font-size: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .entry-meta {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .meta-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .meta-item strong {
    color: var(--text);
    min-width: 80px;
  }

  .meta-item span {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    flex: 1;
  }

  .entry-content {
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .text-content {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 30px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .text-content :global(p) {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .text-content :global(p:last-child) {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .text-content :global(b) {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  .entry-navigation {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 20px;
  }

  .back-link {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary-dark);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .entry-meta {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>